.th CVO I 8/12/77
.sh NAME
cvo - convert Interdata object files to a.out format
.sh SYNOPSIS
cvo infile outfile
.sh DESCRIPTION
Converts the output from the Interdata CAL assembler
into a UNIX a.out file.
.sh AUTHOR
R Miller
.br
University of Wollongong
.sh "SEE ALSO"
a.out(V), cvtask(I)
.sh BUGS
Absolute code is not supported.
.br
Halfword externals are not supported.
.br
If input file contains common block initializations
(BDATA)
it must not have any pure or impure segments.
